{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261eaJR224DA1795266255.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國與亞投行簽署協定，將在香港開設辦公室。</p><p></p><p>國家財政部部長藍佛安和亞投行行長鄒加怡代表簽署協定，確定亞投行於香港設立辦公室，並為特權及豁免與其他有助成立辦公室的事宜制定原則。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FS.AIIB-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CZOwW77e4m1795266281.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>財政司司長陳茂波指，協定充分肯定香港作為國際金融中心的地位，彰顯香港在匯聚國際資本、支持亞洲基礎設施建設的獨特角色。</p><p></p><p>另外，署理財經事務及庫務局局長陳浩濂亦代表特區政府，與亞投行簽署另一份協定，向「項目準備特別基金」注資2,000萬美元，展現對亞投行工作的支持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.492720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T23:53:46.472296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:17.686270+00:00","content_hash":"06b0687619852fb50b54f4b76bfa315a20577c1f2d78d50c937ee27fa85ab321","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.492720+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}